# Binance US API Credentials
# Get these from: https://www.binance.us/en/account/api-management
# 1. Log in to Binance US
# 2. Go to Account → API Management
# 3. Create API Key (can be restricted to read-only)
# 4. Copy the API Key and Secret Key below
VITE_BINANCE_API_KEY=your_binance_us_api_key_here
VITE_BINANCE_SECRET_KEY=your_binance_us_secret_key_here
